 Zellij (test)  Tab #1  + 
                     Close this window?
                     The session "test-N" keeps running and can be attached again.
                     > 1. Detach and leave running in the background.
                       2. Quit and shut down the entire session.
                       3. Cancel
                     <↓↑> select  <Enter> confirm  <1-3> direct  <y> detach  <q> quit  <Esc> cancel
